* **Contrast pairing is mandatory in every theme:** any light background token pairs with a dark text token; any dark background token pairs with a light text token. The accent yellow (`#f2b705`) must never carry light text — pair it with `--color-shadow-ink` text (as `.badge` does). The lurid red (`#d4361f`) may be used as text only at display sizes; for small emphasized text on dark surfaces use the accent instead.
* **Light-mode background rule:** never default to pure white. Light theme uses aged-newsprint paper tones; where a near-white is genuinely required, use `#fefefe`, not `#ffffff`.

